cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Version 1.2.0 is the version described in
  "The Min-Cut Formulation of Ollivier-Ricci Curvature" (arXiv, forthcoming).
type: software
title: "faster-or-curvature: Exact Ollivier-Ricci curvature in exact integer arithmetic"
authors:
  - family-names: Micaletto
    given-names: Giorgio
version: 1.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-30"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GiorgioMB/faster-or-curvature"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/faster-or-curvature/"
keywords:
  - ollivier-ricci curvature
  - optimal transport
  - minimum cut
  - graphs
